diagram sequence
title 결제 시퀀스
user[사용자]{icon: logos:chrome} -> api[주문 API] : POST /checkout
api -> redis[Redis]{shape: db} : 재고 확인
branch 재고 있음
  redis --> api : OK
  api -> pg[결제사] : 승인 요청
  branch 승인
    pg --> api : approved
    api -> kafka[Kafka]{shape: queue} : order.paid
    api --> user : 201
  else 거절
    pg -x api : declined
    api --> user : 402
  end
else 품절
  redis -x api : sold out
  api --> user : 409
end
